<p>Set whether to display a confirmation dialog box before printing starts.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="classificationcode" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Display [Classification Code] Dialog Before Printing</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to display the <span class="Term-Soft">Classification Code</span> dialog box before printing.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="dispusercode" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Display [User Code] Dialog Before Printing</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to display the <span class="Term-Soft">User Code</span> dialog box before printing.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="jobtypedetails" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Display [Change Job Type] Dialog Before Printing</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to display the <span class="Term-Soft">Change Job Type</span> dialog box before printing.</p>
<p>Select <span class="Term-Soft">Always</span> or <span class="Term-Soft">Display when User ID or Required Password is Blank</span>.</p>
<p aria-level="2" class="T1" id="changejobtype" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">[Change Job Type] Dialog Settings</span></p>
<p>Select the initial status of the user ID, password, folder password, and user name from select <span class="Term-Soft">Same as the Set Value in [Change Job Type]</span> or <span class="Term-Soft">Always Blank</span>.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="savesetvalue" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Save Set Value</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to save the entered value.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="default" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Restore Defaults</span></p>
<p>Restores the settings on this dialog box to the default settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
